{"info":{"author":null,"author_email":"Steve Canny <stcanny@gmail.com>","bugtrack_url":null,"classifiers":["Development Status :: 5 - Production/Stable","Environment :: Console","Intended Audience :: Developers","License :: OSI Approved :: MIT License","Operating System :: OS Independent","Programming Language :: Python","Programming Language :: Python :: 3","Programming Language :: Python :: 3.10","Programming Language :: Python :: 3.11","Programming Language :: Python :: 3.7","Programming Language :: Python :: 3.8","Programming Language :: Python :: 3.9","Topic :: Office/Business :: Office Suites","Topic :: Software Development :: Libraries"],"description":"# python-docx\n\n*python-docx* is a Python library for reading, creating, and updating Microsoft Word 2007+ (.docx) files.\n\n## Installation\n\n```\npip install python-docx\n```\n\n## Example\n\n```python\n>>> from docx import Document\n\n>>> document = Document()\n>>> document.add_paragraph(\"It was a dark and stormy night.\")\n<docx.text.paragraph.Paragraph object at 0x10f19e760>\n>>> document.save(\"dark-and-stormy.docx\")\n\n>>> document = Document(\"dark-and-stormy.docx\")\n>>> document.paragraphs[0].text\n'It was a dark and stormy night.'\n```\n\nMore information is available in the [python-docx documentation](https://python-docx.readthedocs.org/en/latest/)\n","description_content_type":"text/markdown","docs_url":null,"download_url":null,"downloads":{"last_day":-1,"last_month":-1,"last_week":-1},"dynamic":["License-File"],"home_page":null,"keywords":"docx, office, openxml, word","license":"MIT","license_expression":null,"license_files":["LICENSE"],"maintainer":null,"maintainer_email":null,"name":"python-docx","package_url":"https://pypi.org/project/python-docx/","platform":null,"project_url":"https://pypi.org/project/python-docx/","project_urls":{"Changelog":"https://github.com/python-openxml/python-docx/blob/master/HISTORY.rst","Documentation":"https://python-docx.readthedocs.org/en/latest/","Homepage":"https://github.com/python-openxml/python-docx","Repository":"https://github.com/python-openxml/python-docx"},"provides_extra":null,"release_url":"https://pypi.org/project/python-docx/1.2.0/","requires_dist":["lxml>=3.1.0","typing_extensions>=4.9.0"],"requires_python":">=3.9","summary":"Create, read, and update Microsoft Word .docx files.","version":"1.2.0","yanked":false,"yanked_reason":null},"last_serial":29651984,"ownership":{"organization":null,"roles":[{"role":"Owner","user":"scanny"}]},"urls":[{"comment_text":null,"core-metadata":{"sha256":"4c4cc819ebe6de4aca44daccfd3f9173e6f46d9ed900ad1c388ff9efb7b6b1d7"},"digests":{"blake2b_256":"d0001e03a4989fa5795da308cd774f05b704ace555a70f9bf9d3be057b680bcf","md5":"f0e72a7afdf7947db39802e23b22dc13","sha256":"3fd478f3250fbbbfd3b94fe1e985955737c145627498896a8a6bf81f4baf66c7"},"downloads":-1,"filename":"python_docx-1.2.0-py3-none-any.whl","has_sig":false,"md5_digest":"f0e72a7afdf7947db39802e23b22dc13","packagetype":"bdist_wheel","python_version":"py3","requires_python":">=3.9","size":252987,"upload_time":"2025-06-16T20:46:22","upload_time_iso_8601":"2025-06-16T20:46:22.506016Z","url":"https://files.pythonhosted.org/packages/d0/00/1e03a4989fa5795da308cd774f05b704ace555a70f9bf9d3be057b680bcf/python_docx-1.2.0-py3-none-any.whl","yanked":false,"yanked_reason":null},{"comment_text":null,"core-metadata":false,"digests":{"blake2b_256":"a9f7eddfe33871520adab45aaa1a71f0402a2252050c14c7e3009446c8f4701c","md5":"33e6052d6583dcb0092d0c80057354aa","sha256":"7bc9d7b7d8a69c9c02ca09216118c86552704edc23bac179283f2e38f86220ce"},"downloads":-1,"filename":"python_docx-1.2.0.tar.gz","has_sig":false,"md5_digest":"33e6052d6583dcb0092d0c80057354aa","packagetype":"sdist","python_version":"source","requires_python":">=3.9","size":5723256,"upload_time":"2025-06-16T20:46:27","upload_time_iso_8601":"2025-06-16T20:46:27.921066Z","url":"https://files.pythonhosted.org/packages/a9/f7/eddfe33871520adab45aaa1a71f0402a2252050c14c7e3009446c8f4701c/python_docx-1.